{"seq":4,"slug":"regional-history","title":"区域历史","stage":"DONE","category":"history","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/regional-history","rating":{"composite":3.7,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":2.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.2,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"区域历史-简介\">区域历史 简介</h1><p>本 hub 以<strong>非西方、非中国的世界各大区域</strong>为单位组织历史叙事，聚焦东亚（中国之外）、中东与伊斯兰世界、非洲、拉丁美洲四大板块。它要回答的核心问题是：当我们暂时移开欧洲与中国这两个最常见的叙事中心，世界其余地区各自走过了怎样独立而又相互交织的历史路径？</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>17_history 下设七个 hub，区域历史与它们的关系如下。明确边界能帮你避免在错误的 hub 里找内容：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hub</th>\n<th>组织维度</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>4_regional-history（本 hub）</strong></td>\n<td>按地理区域（中国/西方之外）</td>\n<td>讲&quot;某个区域内部的完整通史脉络&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ancient-civilizations/\">1_ancient-civilizations</a></td>\n<td>按古代文明</td>\n<td>玛雅、印加、波斯等有<strong>专篇深描</strong>；本 hub 只在区域通史中概览，需细节时跳转该 hub</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../chinese-history/\">2_chinese-history</a></td>\n<td>按中国朝代</td>\n<td>中国本部历史在该 hub；本 hub 只处理中国<strong>周边</strong>（日本、朝鲜、东南亚）及其与中国的互动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../western-history/\">3_western-history</a></td>\n<td>按欧洲/西方时段</td>\n<td>殖民、冷战、工业革命的&quot;宗主国一侧&quot;在该 hub；本 hub 讲这些力量在<strong>被殖民区域</strong>的落地后果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../thematic-history/\">5_thematic-history</a></td>\n<td>按主题（政治/经济/军事/思想…）</td>\n<td>跨区域<strong>横切</strong>比较在该 hub；本 hub 是单区域<strong>纵向</strong>通史</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../technology-history/\">6_technology-history</a></td>\n<td>按技术演进</td>\n<td>技术专题在该 hub</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../historiography-historical-method/\">7_historiography-historical-method</a></td>\n<td>史学方法论</td>\n<td>&quot;如何研究历史&quot;在该 hub</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话区分：<strong>同一段殖民史，宗主国视角去 3_western-history，主题比较去 5_thematic-history，被殖民区域的内部演变在本 hub。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"章节构成\">章节构成</h2><ul>\n<li>第1章 <strong>东亚历史</strong> —— 日本（律令制→幕府→明治维新→战后）、朝鲜半岛（三国→高丽朝鲜→日据→南北分治）、东南亚（印度化→伊斯兰化→殖民→东盟）。</li>\n<li>第2章 <strong>中东与伊斯兰文明</strong> —— 伊斯兰教的兴起与哈里发扩张、奥斯曼帝国的兴衰、奥斯曼解体后的现代中东格局。</li>\n<li>第3章 <strong>非洲历史</strong> —— 古代非洲帝国（库施、马里、桑海、大津巴布韦）、奴隶贸易与殖民瓜分、二十世纪独立运动。</li>\n<li>第4章 <strong>拉丁美洲历史</strong> —— 前哥伦布文明（玛雅、阿兹特克、印加）、西葡殖民体制、独立运动与现代发展。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径-分人群\">推荐学习路径（分人群）</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>历史入门者 / 中文读者</strong>：从第1章东亚入手——文化背景最亲近，律令制、科举、儒教等概念可与中国史互参；再读第4章拉美（叙事相对独立、戏剧性强），最后读第2、3章（概念密度高、与当代热点纠缠深）。</li>\n<li><strong>关注当代国际局势者</strong>：直接切入第2章中东与第3章非洲，理解今日冲突的殖民与冷战根源；读完可顺延至 <a href=\"../../geography-geopolitics/geopolitics/contemporary-geopolitics/\">当代地缘政治</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>做跨区域比较者</strong>：四章可乱序读，重点抓&quot;殖民—独立&quot;这条贯穿非洲、拉美、东南亚的共同主线，再回到 <a href=\"../thematic-history/international-relations/colonial-system\">5_thematic-history 的殖民体系篇</a>做横向收束。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>四个区域两两对照——非洲与拉美的去殖民化、东亚与中东的传统帝国转型——比孤立阅读任何一个区域都更能揭示世界史的结构性规律。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>必备</strong>：初中世界历史常识（大致知道&quot;古代—中世纪—近代—现代&quot;的时间框架，能定位主要大洲）。</li>\n<li><strong>建议先读</strong>：若对&quot;殖民主义&quot;&quot;民族国家&quot;&quot;冷战&quot;等贯穿性概念陌生，可先浏览 <a href=\"../western-history/age-of-discovery/\">3_western-history 的地理大发现</a> 与 <a href=\"../western-history/cold-war/\">冷战</a> 两个 hub，再读本 hub 会顺畅许多。</li>\n<li><strong>无需</strong>：不要求专业史学训练，也不要求预先掌握任何区域的语言或文化背景——每章均从该区域的&quot;核心概念&quot;表起步。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"east-asia","title":"东亚历史","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/regional-history/east-asia","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"japan-history","title":"日本历史","url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/regional-history/east-asia/japan-history"},{"seq":2,"slug":"korean-peninsula","title":"朝鲜半岛历史","url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/regional-history/east-asia/korean-peninsula"},{"seq":3,"slug":"southeast-asia","title":"东南亚历史","url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/regional-history/east-asia/southeast-asia"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"middle-east-islam","title":"中东与伊斯兰文明","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/regional-history/middle-east-islam","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"islam-rise","title":"伊斯兰教的兴起与扩张","url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/regional-history/middle-east-islam/islam-rise"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ottoman-empire","title":"奥斯曼帝国","url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/regional-history/middle-east-islam/ottoman-empire"},{"seq":3,"slug":"modern-middle-east","title":"现代中东格局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/regional-history/middle-east-islam/modern-middle-east"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"africa","title":"非洲历史","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/regional-history/africa","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ancient-africa","title":"古代非洲文明","url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/regional-history/africa/ancient-africa"},{"seq":2,"slug":"colonialism-slave-trade","title":"殖民与奴隶贸易","url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/regional-history/africa/colonialism-slave-trade"},{"seq":3,"slug":"african-independence","title":"非洲独立运动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/regional-history/africa/african-independence"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"latin-america","title":"拉丁美洲历史","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/regional-history/latin-america","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pre-columbian","title":"前哥伦布时代文明","url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/regional-history/latin-america/pre-columbian"},{"seq":2,"slug":"colonial-period","title":"殖民时期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/regional-history/latin-america/colonial-period"},{"seq":3,"slug":"independence-movements","title":"独立运动与现代发展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/history/regional-history/latin-america/independence-movements"}]}]}